@startuml
!include style.iuml
[*] --> Confirmed
Confirmed --> Accepted : vendor / auto (4 h)
Confirmed --> Cancelled : customer / system
Accepted --> Packed
Packed --> Cancelled : pre-manifest only
Packed --> Shipped : handover scan
Shipped --> OutForDelivery
OutForDelivery --> Delivered : POD rule
OutForDelivery --> NDR
NDR --> OutForDelivery : re-attempt <= 3
NDR --> RTO_Initiated : attempts exhausted / refused
RTO_Initiated --> RTO_Received
Delivered --> ReturnRequested : window (BRU-07)
ReturnRequested --> ReturnPickedUp
ReturnPickedUp --> QC
QC --> Refunded : pass
QC --> ReturnRejected : fail
Delivered --> Closed : window lapse
Refunded --> Closed
RTO_Received --> Closed : restock + fees
Cancelled --> Closed
ReturnRejected --> Closed : dispute path noted
Closed --> [*]
@enduml
